```
POST /spend/calculate
{
    "completion_response": {
        "model": "openrouter/anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet",
        "usage": {
            "prompt_tokens": 1000000,
            "completion_tokens": 0
        }
    }
}

Response:
{
  "cost": 3.0
}

POST /spend/calculate
{
  "completion_response": {
    "model": "openrouter/anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet",
    "usage": {
      "prompt_tokens": 0,
      "completion_tokens": 1000000
    }
  }
}

Response:
{
  "cost": 15.0
}
```

